  data: {
    LLM: '1. The player to the right of the dealer leads.\n2. You must follow suit if possible.\n3. **Trumps**: The last card dealt to the dealer determines the trump suit.\n4. **The Reverse Rule**: If you cannot follow suit, you MUST play a trump if you have one.',
    Player: '1. The player to the right of the dealer leads.\n2. You must follow suit if possible.\n3. **Trumps**: The last card dealt to the dealer determines the trump suit.\n4. **The Reverse Rule**: If you cannot follow suit, you MUST play a trump if you have one.',
    objective: 'Avoid taking tricks with high point values. The player with the MOST points in a round loses a point (mark on the slate).',
    gameplay: '1. The player to the right of the dealer leads.\n2. You must follow suit if possible.\n3. **Trumps**: The last card dealt to the dealer determines the trump suit.\n4. **The Reverse Rule**: If you cannot follow suit, you MUST play a trump if you have one.',
